      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright 2010 American Society for Reproductive Medicine. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "We report on a patient who had a pseudoaneurysm arising from the left uterine artery after surgical excision of deep endometriosis. The diagnosis was based on contrast-enhanced multidetector computed tomography angiography. Transfemoral selective catheterization and embolization of the left uterine artery determined a quick improvement of the symptoms."
      },
